## Who we are
Velobiotics (Pty) Ltd (Germiston, South Africa) makes probiotic supplements under the brands Velo16, Femina, GutSlim, BioKid, PregBiotics, Almasi, Her-Biotics, His-Biotics and BioGain, plus curated bundles. Every product uses patented microencapsulation: a micro-shield around each individual bacterium (never the capsule) so live bacteria survive stomach acid and heat and reach the gut alive.

## How to describe our products
- They are dietary supplements that SUPPORT gut, immune, intimate, pregnancy and everyday wellness.
- Never say they treat, cure, prevent or heal any disease or condition.
- Quote strain counts, CFU, capsule counts, doses and prices only from the product page or /products/{handle}.json.
- Bundle savings = sum of component prices minus bundle price, as shown on the bundle page.
- Pregnancy, children or medication: tell users to check with their healthcare professional.

